			"notes": "- Update for Minecraft 1.20.2.\n- Add new variant of tents with cherry wood poles.\n- Halve the distance the player can be from their campfire before their rest is canceled.\n  - The distance for normal campfires is now 7.5 blocks.\n  - The distance for soul campfires is now 5 blocks.\n- Many mixins were migrated to use MixinExtras where applicable.\n  - This should allow us to be compatible with more mods."
		},
